<td id="A1.T6.4.18.5" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center">90.16</td>
<td id="A1.T6.4.18.6" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center" style="--ltx-bg-color:#DFDFDF;"><span id="A1.T6.4.18.6.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="--ltx-bg-color:#DFDFDF;">56.97</span></td></tr>
<tr id="A1.T6.4.19" class="ltx_tr">
<th id="A1.T6.4.19.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_th ltx_th_row ltx_border_r">LLaVa-NEXT, <math id="A1.T6.m21" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\tau=0.5" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>τ</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0.5</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\tau=0.5</annotation></semantics></math></th>
<td id="A1.T6.4.19.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center">30.07</td>
<td id="A1.T6.4.19.3" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center">51.99</td>
<td id="A1.T6.4.19.4" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center">52.09</td>
<td id="A1.T6.4.19.5" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center">66.68</td>
<td id="A1.T6.4.19.6" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center" style="--ltx-bg-color:#DFDFDF;"><span id="A1.T6.4.19.6.1" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-bg-color:#DFDFDF;">48.53</span></td></tr>
<tr id="A1.T6.4.20" class="ltx_tr">
<th id="A1.T6.4.20.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_th ltx_th_row ltx_border_r">+ Constant <math id="A1.T6.m22" class="ltx_Math" alttext="T" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>T</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">T</annotation></semantics></math></th>
<td id="A1.T6.4.20.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center">32.31</td>
<td id="A1.T6.4.20.3" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center">53.84</td>
<td id="A1.T6.4.20.4" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center">93.4</td>
<td id="A1.T6.4.20.5" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center">95.31</td>
<td id="A1.T6.4.20.6" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center" style="--ltx-bg-color:#DFDFDF;"><span id="A1.T6.4.20.6.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="--ltx-bg-color:#DFDFDF;">59.15</span></td></tr>
<tr id="A1.T6.4.21" class="ltx_tr">
<th id="A1.T6.4.21.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_th ltx_th_row ltx_border_r">LLaVa-NEXT, <math id="A1.T6.m23" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\tau=1" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>τ</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\tau=1</annotation></semantics></math></th>
<td id="A1.T6.4.21.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center">30.07</td>
<td id="A1.T6.4.21.3" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center">51.99</td>
<td id="A1.T6.4.21.4" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center">52.09</td>
<td id="A1.T6.4.21.5" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center">66.68</td>
<td id="A1.T6.4.21.6" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center" style="--ltx-bg-color:#DFDFDF;"><span id="A1.T6.4.21.6.1" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-bg-color:#DFDFDF;">48.53</span></td></tr>
<tr id="A1.T6.4.22" class="ltx_tr">
<th id="A1.T6.4.22.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_th ltx_th_row ltx_border_bb ltx_border_r">+ Constant <math id="A1.T6.m24" class="ltx_Math" alttext="T" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>T</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">T</annotation></semantics></math></th>
<td id="A1.T6.4.22.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center ltx_border_bb">32.31</td>
<td id="A1.T6.4.22.3" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center ltx_border_bb">53.84</td>
<td id="A1.T6.4.22.4" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center ltx_border_bb">93.4</td>
<td id="A1.T6.4.22.5" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center ltx_border_bb">95.31</td>
<td id="A1.T6.4.22.6" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center ltx_border_bb" style="--ltx-bg-color:#DFDFDF;"><span id="A1.T6.4.22.6.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="--ltx-bg-color:#DFDFDF;">59.15</span></td></tr>
</tbody>
</table>
</figure>
<div id="A1.SS1.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A1.SS1.p1.1" class="ltx_p">We conduct an ablation to assess the impact of decoding temperature <math id="A1.SS1.p1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\tau" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>τ</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\tau</annotation></semantics></math> on our test-time consistency framework using LLaVA-NEXT across three perturbation types: <span id="A1.SS1.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">Question Rephrasing</span>, <span id="A1.SS1.p1.1.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">Image Restyling</span>, and <span id="A1.SS1.p1.1.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">Context Reasoning</span> (Table <a href="#A1.T6" title="Table 6 ‣ A.1 Ablation on Decoding Temperature ‣ Appendix A Appendix ‣ Test-Time Consistency in Vision Language Models" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">6</span></a>).</p>
</div>
<div id="A1.SS1.p2" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A1.SS1.p2.1" class="ltx_p">Across all perturbations, our method improves consistency and overall robustness regardless of the temperature setting. Notably:</p>
<ul id="A1.I1" class="ltx_itemize ltx_leftmargin_flush">
<li id="A1.I1.i1" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">•</span> 
<div id="A1.I1.i1.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A1.I1.i1.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.I1.i1.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Question Rephrasing:</span> Our test-time strategy consistently boosts performance to a peak <math id="A1.I1.i1.p1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="O_{all}=\textbf{68.25}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>O</mi><mrow><mi>a</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>l</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>l</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mtext class="ltx_mathvariant_bold">68.25</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">O_{all}=\textbf{68.25}</annotation></semantics></math> for all values of <math id="A1.I1.i1.p1.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\tau" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>τ</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\tau</annotation></semantics></math>, indicating stable performance across decoding scales and strong resilience to linguistic variations.</p>
</div></li>
<li id="A1.I1.i2" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">•</span> 
<div id="A1.I1.i2.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A1.I1.i2.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.I1.i2.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Image Restyling:</span> While baseline performance is lower due to visual perturbations, our method still yields significant improvements. The best result is observed at <math id="A1.I1.i2.p1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\tau=0" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>τ</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\tau=0</annotation></semantics></math>, where <math id="A1.I1.i2.p1.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="O_{all}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi>O</mi><mrow><mi>a</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>l</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>l</mi></mrow></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">O_{all}</annotation></semantics></math> improves from 40.27 to <span id="A1.I1.i2.p1.1.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">45.80</span>, a gain of 5.5 points.</p>
</div></li>
<li id="A1.I1.i3" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">•</span> 
<div id="A1.I1.i3.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A1.I1.i3.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.I1.i3.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Context Reasoning:</span> This task benefits most from our consistency framework. The best performance, <math id="A1.I1.i3.p1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="O_{all}=\textbf{59.15}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>O</mi><mrow><mi>a</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>l</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>l</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mtext class="ltx_mathvariant_bold">59.15</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">O_{all}=\textbf{59.15}</annotation></semantics></math>, is achieved at both <math id="A1.I1.i3.p1.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\tau=0.5" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>τ</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0.5</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\tau=0.5</annotation></semantics></math> and <math id="A1.I1.i3.p1.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\tau=1" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>τ</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\tau=1</annotation></semantics></math>, indicating that our method improves reasoning-heavy tasks.</p>
</div></li>
</ul>
</div>
<div id="A1.SS1.p3" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A1.SS1.p3.1" class="ltx_p">These results demonstrate that our approach is robust to temperature variation and consistently enhances consistency and semantic alignment across all perturbation categories.</p>
</div>
<figure id="A1.F4" class="ltx_figure"><img src="2506.22395v1/qualitative_rephrasing.png" id="A1.F4.g1" class="ltx_graphics ltx_centering ltx_img_landscape" style="aspect-ratio:476/204;" width="476" height="204" alt="Refer to caption">
